Date-Tiny-Math

This module derives from Date::Tiny and adds some calendar date math
capabilities.  This module is a pure Perl module, not dependent on any
non-standard modules.

INSTALLATION

To install this module, run the following commands:

	perl Makefile.PL
	make
	make test
	make install

SUPPORT AND DOCUMENTATION

After installing, you can find documentation for this module with the
perldoc command.

    perldoc Date::Tiny::Math

You can also look for information at:

    RT, CPAN's request tracker (report bugs here)
        https://rt.cpan.org/NoAuth/Bugs.html?Dist=Date-Tiny-Math

    CPAN Ratings
        https://cpanratings.perl.org/d/Date-Tiny-Math

    Search CPAN
        https://metacpan.org/release/Date-Tiny-Math


